Third-party content

The MIT license above covers the IDOL AI application code in this repository
(server/, shared/, web/, tests/, scripts/, and configuration).

The files under `huggingface/speridlabs-idol/` are documentation and model
artifacts mirrored from a separate project for use as a demo knowledge corpus.
They are not covered by the MIT license above and remain the property of their
original authors; refer to that project for its licensing terms. If you deploy
IDOL AI for your own content, point `IDOL_LOCAL_DIR` or `IDOL_DEFAULT_REPO` at
your own repository instead.
